claim.claim-text:
an instrument tube defining the longitudinal axis of the instrument and configured to accommodate mechanical transmission elements;
an articulated end-effector at a distal extremity of the instrument tube, comprising at least 2 end-effector links and at least two rotation joints;
a set of at least 2 rotating elements, placed at a proximal extremity of the instrument tube, configured to actuate the at least 2 end-effector links of the articulated end-effector;
mechanical transmission elements, passing through the instrument tube, configured to transmit motion from each rotating element to the respective moving link of the articulated end-effector; and
at least one amplification element, being mounted between an end-effector link and its mechanical transmission elements.
